{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121617","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121617/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121617/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121617/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121617","id":4943795972,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc70muE9","number":121617,"title":"Add and apply `RETURN_IF_ERROR` to return an `Error` when it's not `OK`.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":13,"created_at":"2026-07-21T23:02:09Z","updated_at":"2026-08-10T16:35:09Z","closed_at":"2026-08-10T16:14:37Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121617","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121617","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121617.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121617.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-10T16:14:37Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nAdds syntactical sugar to a common error handling pattern: Silently returning an `Error` when it's not `OK`.\r\nThis happens at least 200x in the codebase; probably way more in practice.\r\n\r\nBy adding this syntactical sugar, we incentivise silent error handling, which helps when the caller is supposed to decide whether to fail loudly or silently. In addition, it makes it easy and painless to swap loud failures like `ERR_FAIL_COND_V(err, err)` to silent ones like `GUARD_OK(err)`, if this turns out to be more appropriate.\r\n\r\nIt also makes these places easier to identify in case we ever want to rework our error handling.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nUses found and auto-swapped using the following regex:\r\n\r\n```\r\n(?:const )?Error (\\w+) = (.*);\\n\\s+if \\(\\1( != OK)?\\) \\{\\n\\s+return \\1;\\n\\s+\\}\r\nGUARD_OK($2);\r\n```\r\n\r\nOnly needed some minor fixes afterwards, where the declared `Error` was used by other code afterwards.\r\nBecause we disallow shadowing this should be safe.\r\n\r\nAn alternative implementation might be `Error` type agnostic, being called `RETURN_IF_TRUE` (or something) instead. However, I think this is overzealous — the only thing we currently handle with macros like this is `Error` (and lately required parameters) and I think staying low tech is preferable.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121617/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":4,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":5},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121617/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}